{"kind":"artifact","text":"The live-attention foundation at internal/nexus on exact head ea5702873f33652c7e472379393fd1b2fec7e9d7. Adds activityChangedAt, observed by the resident and moved only when status, focus or note actually changes so a heartbeat renewal does not report the polling interval as a decision; and FocusedOn, which reports live actors whose leased focus exactly contains identifiers the caller already holds. Matching is exact string equality with no prefix or inference, the caller's own sessions are filtered before actors are aggregated so one person in two windows is one row, identity is keyed on the durable fingerprint so a shared display name does not merge two actors, and the result is capped at 16 with the remainder counted. Tests cover boundedness, expiry, renewal age, multi-session aggregation, repetition until acknowledgement, and impersonation; each was verified by mutation.","body":{"commit":"ea5702873f33652c7e472379393fd1b2fec7e9d7","path":"internal/nexus"}}